<span class="sc-wall-v1__measure-point" data-sc-wall-point-b hidden>2</span>
<div class="sc-wall-v1__tap-instruction" data-sc-wall-tap-instruction hidden></div>

<div class="sc-wall-v1__tap-demo" data-sc-wall-tap-demo hidden aria-hidden="true">
