<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="2.25"></circle>
</svg>
</span>
<span data-sc-wall-confirm-label aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Place</span>
<span class="sc-wall-v1__confirm-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</button>
</div>

<div class="sc-wall-v1__scale-help" data-sc-wall-scale-help hidden>
<button type="button" class="sc-wall-v1__scale-help-close" data-sc-wall-scale-help-close aria-label="Close scale help">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"></path>
</svg>
</button>
<div class="sc-wall-v1__scale-help-head">
<div class="sc-wall-v1__scale-help-heading">
<span class="sc-wall-v1__scale-help-eyebrow">TRUE SCALE</span>
<strong data-sc-wall-scale-help-title>Get the real size</strong>
</div>
</div>
<p data-sc-wall-scale-copy-start>Tap both sides of something you know the size of, then enter the distance in <span data-sc-wall-scale-unit-inline>{{ sc_wall_unit }}</span>.</p>
<p data-sc-wall-scale-copy-second hidden>Perfect — now tap the other side.</p>
<div class="sc-wall-v1__scale-entry" data-sc-wall-scale-entry hidden>
